# AXI_ooo.md Phase 3, THIRD fix pass -- the expanded validation sample.
#
# This is p3r_sample.list (the second-round sample) PLUS the two tests the
# second-round adversarial review found it had excluded -- the only two in the
# suite that exercise this checker's CONTENT and owed mechanisms at all:
#   axi4_same_id_nonadjacent_reorder_test  -> content_adjudicated > 0
#   axi4_outstanding_depth_test            -> the window/survivability gates and
#                                             the sb_sameid_ar_owed skip path
# Without them the round-2 sample reported content_adjudicated=0 and skipped=0
# everywhere, i.e. it regression-tested neither of that round's two fixes.
#
# Run: python3 axi4_regression.py --lsf --test-list p3t3_sample.list -p 20 -t 1200

axi4_arlen_out_of_spec_test
